    "endMs": 42508,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "小林抬腕，手表更新方位。姿态稳定后，显示方向。",
    "startMs": 44550,
    "endMs": 50238,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "她回头确认，靠边让行。",
