    "startMs": 69508,
    "endMs": 74188,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "手臂下垂时，先提醒类别；抬腕后，结合姿态更新方向。",
    "startMs": 76550,
    "endMs": 82430,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
