    "endMs": 89140,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "角度相对当前表盘，不是身体朝向。",
    "startMs": 89370,
    "endMs": 93090,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "路口车辆靠近，手表识别鸣笛，发出两次长振。",
